      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FREYA LEGEND (1) is a promising type who notched her 9th career success when too good (17.03) at Murray Bridge last time. Has a strong record here including five wins. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. The one to beat again. CRYSTAL CROWN (6) was out of the placings last time but shapes well for this on her fast win the start prior, getting around Gawler over 400m in 22.85. Rates a leading chance if runs up to recent winning time. LUCY SCHOOL (8) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish 1.5 lengths away in second (17.40) behind El Rey at this track. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Can measure up. YARRAMUNDI OPAL (2) has won at this course and distance and warrants respect.",
